{"sections":[{"slug":"ζ-函数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"ζ-函数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"ζ-函数"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">复代数簇</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于光滑复</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/射影簇","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">射影簇</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">与映射</span> $f\\colon X\\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义关于</span> $t$ <span lang=\"zh\">的形式幂级数</span>\n$$\r\n\tZ(X,f,t) = \\prod_i \\det(1-f^*|_{H^i(X,\\mathbb{C})} t) ^{(-1)^{i+1}},\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">有限域上的代数簇</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于有限域</span> $\\mathbb F_q$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的拟射影代数簇</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\nZ(X,T) = \\exp \\left(\\sum_{r=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{T^r}{r}\\# X(\\mathbb F_{q^r})\\right),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\zeta(s) = Z(X,q^{-s})$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">函数域</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/函数域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">函数域</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathcal O_K$ <span lang=\"zh\">为其整数环</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">几何上意味着将</span> $\\mathbb A^1=\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb F_q[t]$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/正规化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正规化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为光滑仿射曲线</span> $\\mathcal U=\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O_K$.\n$$\r\n\\zeta(s) = \\prod_{\\mathfrak p}\\frac{1}{1-|\\mathcal O_K / \\mathfrak p|^{-s}},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">它是</span> $T=q^{-s}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的形式幂级数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">几何上</span> $\\mathfrak p$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应曲线</span> $U$ <span lang=\"zh\">的闭点</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">可以证明</span>\n$$\r\n\\zeta(s)=\\exp\\Bigg(\r\n\t\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\frac{q^{-ns}}{n}|U(\\mathbb F_{q^n})|\r\n\\Bigg).\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">取对数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这是一个好的练习</span>.)</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">曲线上的无穷</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/位","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">位</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">和其余的位是相似的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">不应区分</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这就是说应该考虑</span> $\\mathbb P^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">在曲线中的正规化</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">作为射影曲线</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Weil猜想","text":"Weil <span lang=\"zh\">猜想</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">数域</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">数域</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathcal O_K$ <span lang=\"zh\">为其整数环</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Dedekindζ-函数","text":"Dedekind ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\zeta(s) = \\sum_{\\mathfrak a\\subset\\mathcal O_K}\\frac{1}{(\\# \\mathcal O_K / \\mathfrak a)^s} = \\prod_{\\mathfrak p\\subset\\mathcal O_K\\,\\text{prime}}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{(\\#\\mathcal O_K / \\mathfrak p)^s}\\right)^{-1}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $\\mathcal O_K=\\mathbb{Z}$ <span lang=\"zh\">时这是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemannζ-函数","text":"Riemann ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">椭圆算子</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于椭圆算子</span> $H$, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数是如下函数的解析延拓</span>:\n$$\r\n\\zeta(s) = \\operatorname{tr}\\Big(\\frac{1}{H}\\Big)^s = \\text{``}\\,\\sum_\\lambda \\lambda ^{-s}\\,\\text{''}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann面","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Laplace算子","text":"Laplace <span lang=\"zh\">算子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这称为</span> Selberg ζ-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$$\r\nZ(\\mathbb A^n,T) = \\frac{1}{1-q^n T}.\r\n$$\n$$\r\nZ(\\mathbb P^n,T) = \\frac{1}{(1-T)(1-qT)\\cdots (1-q^n T)}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆曲线","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线</span>"}},{"Plain":" $E_{/\\mathbb F_q}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Frobenius态射","text":"Frobenius <span lang=\"zh\">态射</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">次方的不动点为</span> $\\# E(\\mathbb F_{q^n})$, <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span> $\\deg (\\mathrm{id}-\\mathrm{Frob}^n)$ (?).</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Frob act on Tate modules?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Generalize to abelian varieties?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/函数域类比","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">函数域类比</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}